# Keep the repo's stored line endings authoritative on every platform.
#
# index.html's CSP carries SHA-256 hashes of its five inline scripts. A
# checkout that rewrites LF to CRLF changes what those scripts hash to, so
# scripts/verify-build.js reports all five hashes as stale on an otherwise
# untouched clone. The tempting fix — recompute the hashes — would commit
# hashes derived from CRLF content and silently break the CSP for everyone
# else. Normalizing on checkout removes the trap.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows batch files need CRLF to run. Stored CRLF already; leave verbatim.
*.bat -text

# Binary assets — never inspected, never converted.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.bin  binary
*.jar  binary
